00:13:54,834 --> 00:13:56,246
This is who I really am.

254
00:13:56,334 --> 00:13:57,871
Those other feelings are fake.

255
00:13:57,954 --> 00:13:58,784
Seriously, though.

256
00:13:58,867 --> 00:14:00,374
She smells so good!

257
00:14:04,814 --> 00:14:06,471
Breathing down my neck as usual.

258
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:09,142
I want more than anything
to see your smile.

259
00:14:09,274 --> 00:14:10,104
What's that?

260
00:14:10,187 --> 00:14:11,017
What's wrong with you?

261
00:14:11,100 --> 00:14:14,231
I just really hope you two will
make up as quickly as possible.

262
00:14:14,314 --> 00:14:15,314
Hey, Tatsubana?

263
00:14:15,534 --> 00:14:16,416
Bye, thank you.

264
00:14:16,574 --> 00:14:17,986
I really like you a lot.

265
00:14:18,634 --> 00:14:19,574
Who are you?

266
00:14:20,194 --> 00:14:21,024
Huh?

267
00:14:21,334 --> 00:14:22,494
Did I summon you?

268
00:14:23,414 --> 00:14:24,794
The hero is you!

269
00:14:24,954 --> 00:14:26,574
I had no idea! Princess!

270
00:14:26,974 --> 00:14:27,994
Wait, princess?

271
00:14:30,054 --> 00:14:30,884
Welcome.

272
00:14:30,967 --> 00:14:34,131
I am the first princess of this
kingdom and I'm called Yigrain.

273
00:14:34,214 --> 00:14:38,594
Last night I didn't know who you were
and I was terribly impolite. I see.

274
00:14:38,814 --> 00:14:41,755
So she's the reason
Tachibana's acting so strange.

275
00:14:42,454 --> 00:14:45,748
Honored hero, I've come before
you today with a request.

276
00:14:46,054 --> 00:14:50,819
Would you please take me with you on your
great journey to defeat the Demon Lord?

277
00:14:51,794 --> 00:14:53,434
It feels like destiny!

278
00:14:54,174 --> 00:14:56,554
Oh, hero, allow me to accompany you!

279
00:14:57,034 --> 00:14:58,614
Please, I'm begging you!

280
00:15:00,094 --> 00:15:01,674
No, of course you can't.

281
00:15:03,074 --> 00:15:06,133
Our journey here is difficult,
dirty, and dangerous.

282
00:15:06,454 --> 00:15:07,689
Call it the three Ds.

283
00:15:07,794 --> 00:15:11,323
Far from the kind of carefree
fantasy a child might imagine.

284
00:15:11,574 --> 00:15:12,794
Ah, there it is.

285
00:15:13,374 --> 00:15:14,204
Condescension.

286
00:15:14,287 --> 00:15:15,117
What a shock.

287
00:15:16,814 --> 00:15:19,771
Would you please kindly stay
out of this conversation?

288
00:15:19,854 --> 00:15:23,051
I happen to be addressing our
honored hero right at the moment.

289
00:15:23,134 --> 00:15:23,964
Really?

290
00:15:24,047 --> 00:15:25,531
You know what you should do?

291
00:15:25,614 --> 00:15:27,991
You should try going out
and having a little fun.

292
00:15:28,074 --> 00:15:30,311
You're obviously serious and intelligent.

293
00:15:30,394 --> 00:15:33,218
But you don't know much
about the world, do you?

294
00:15:33,434 --> 00:15:38,022
Truth be told, you have every appearance
of a stiff and pointless kind of man.

295
00:15:40,274 --> 00:15:42,098
It's always just been the same.

296
00:15:42,214 --> 00:15:44,038
Prideful men are all like this.

297
00:15:46,434 --> 00:15:47,811
Jinguuji, what are you doing?!

298
00:15:47,894 --> 00:15:50,191
I know you're angry, but Arson
is not the answer, buddy!

299
00:15:50,274 --> 00:15:52,098
Please, let's think about this!

300
00:15:57,074 --> 00:15:57,904
Oh,

301
00:15:57,987 --> 00:16:00,411
this is like when a supervisor
once asked for a party-level

302
00:16:00,494 --> 00:16:03,251
trick performance and Jinguuji
made the fire alarm go off,

303
00:16:03,334 --> 00:16:05,591
which then resulted in party
tricks being declared forbidden

304
00:16:05,674 --> 00:16:08,351
on the spot all because of
his ultra-special technique,

305
00:16:08,434 --> 00:16:09,434
fire breathing!

306
00:16:10,214 --> 00:16:13,685
So tell me, was that entertaining
enough for you, princess?

307
00:16:13,774 --> 00:16:14,954
Wow, this guy.

308
00:16:15,214 --> 00:16:18,651
I assume you meant it as revenge
for my treating you like a child,

309
00:16:18,734 --> 00:16:20,991
but I fear you've picked
the wrong opponent.

310
00:16:21,074 --> 00:16:23,662
Unfortunately, there
is nothing I cannot do.

311
00:16:23,914 --> 00:16:27,032
Why do you want to travel
with us in the first place?

312
00:16:27,374 --> 00:16:28,204
It's not.

313
00:16:29,254 --> 00:16:31,195
That's enough, isn't it, Jinguji?

314
00:16:31,354 --> 00:16:34,371
She's hesitating because she's got
a reason not to tell us, right?

315
00:16:34,454 --> 00:16:36,160
Pushing it would be childish.

316
00:16:36,474 --> 00:16:37,514
Oh, my hero.

317
00:16:38,494 --> 00:16:39,324
Tachibana.

318
00:16:39,407 --> 00:16:44,754
I'm really sorry, dude, but logic and
reasoning is not gonna work on a kid like her.

319
00:16:45,174 --> 00:16:46,734
It's too much of a risk.

320
00:16:47,514 --> 00:16:48,554
Goodbye, world.

321
00:16:49,114 --> 00:16:51,071
The thought of accidentally
pushing her over

322
00:16:51,154 --> 00:16:53,791
the edge literally scares
the crap out of me.

323
00:16:53,874 --> 00:16:55,431
We gotta try some other tactic.

324
00:16:55,514 --> 00:16:56,573
Something gentler.

325
00:16:57,134 --> 00:16:59,314
Oh, of course you can't go! No!

326
00:17:01,614 --> 00:17:03,411
Suddenly you must go on a journey?

327
00:17:03,494 --> 00:17:05,491
What about your official duties then?

328
00:17:05,574 --> 00:17:09,511
And besides all that, siding against
the demon lord will be dangerous.

329
00:17:09,594 --> 00:17:10,424
That's right.

330
00:17:10,507 --> 00:17:14,071
When dealing with stubborn kids, sometimes
it's best to turn to their parent.

331
00:17:14,154 --> 00:17:14,984
Think about it,

332
00:17:15,067 --> 00:17:17,191
you can't even get dressed
by yourself and you can't

333
00:17:17,274 --> 00:17:19,591
get to sleep without
holding your favorite doll.

334
00:17:19,674 --> 00:17:21,909
I wasn't expecting a public execution.

335
00:17:22,954 --> 00:17:24,778
Impressive as usual, Tachibana.

336
00:17:24,954 --> 00:17:26,731
Leaving this to her
father means her heart is

337
00:17:26,814 --> 00:17:29,755
guaranteed to be smoothly
and efficiently crushed.

338
00:17:29,954 --> 00:17:33,091
I was right in thinking you're
suited to human resources.

339
00:17:33,174 --> 00:17:35,351
I wish you'd punch me
for foolishly believing

340
00:17:35,434 --> 00:17:37,551
you wanted to bring a
woman on our journey.

341
00:17:37,634 --> 00:17:39,516
What do you think, honored hero?

342
00:17:39,654 --> 00:17:40,713
As things stand...

343
00:17:41,394 --> 00:17:43,512
It is just as you say, Your Majesty.

344
00:17:43,734 --> 00:17:46,931
At the least, she should be able to
go to the bathroom alone at night.

345
00:17:47,014 --> 00:17:48,574
And as royalty...

346
00:17:49,314 --> 00:17:51,294
Why are you making it worse?

347
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:54,654
Don't panic, Tachibana. It's all right.

348
00:17:54,834 --> 00:17:56,128
I know what's up here.

349
00:17:56,814 --> 00:17:59,131
Break her until there's
nothing left, right?

350
00:17:59,214 --> 00:18:01,291
He doesn't know what's up at all!

351
00:18:01,374 --> 00:18:03,614
Biggie, you understand, don't you?

352
00:18:03,894 --> 00:18:07,541
You mustn't ask for things like
a willful child might anymore.

353
00:18:08,414 --> 00:18:09,354
Oh, father.

354
00:18:09,694 --> 00:18:10,714
It slipped.

355
00:18:12,294 --> 00:18:15,434
And Four Eyes, are you
having fun looking so smug?

356
00:18:15,634 --> 00:18:18,458
Even though you don't
understand a single thing?

357
00:18:19,194 --> 00:18:21,429
This is ridiculous, everyone's stupid!

358
00:18:21,574 --> 00:18:22,651
Hey, Moji, guess what?

359
00:18:22,734 --> 00:18:24,731
I don't care about demon
lords or heroes anymore!

360
00:18:24,814 --> 00:18:26,571
This Moji never will ever get the dog!

361
00:18:26,654 --> 00:18:27,794
Wait, so she knew?

362
00:18:28,194 --> 00:18:30,135
Your Majesty, please stay strong!

363
00:18:30,654 --> 00:18:31,484
Princess?

364
00:18:31,574 --> 00:18:32,515
Wait, Tachibana.

365
00:18:32,674 --> 00:18:35,791
We may be inside the castle, but
you can't go off on your own.

366
00:18:35,874 --> 00:18:37,354
You better not follow me.

367
00:18:37,534 --> 00:18:39,951
You are the worst at
dealing with teenagers.

368
00:18:40,034 --> 00:18:41,446
I need to do this alone.

369
00:18:44,434 --> 00:18:45,846
Princess, are you there?

370
00:18:47,494 --> 00:18:48,394
What the what?

371
00:18:48,574 --> 00:18:49,692
What are you doing?

372
00:18:50,594 --> 00:18:52,829
Well, obviously, I'm venting my anger.

373
00:18:52,954 --> 00:18:54,174
I can see that.

374
00:18:54,394 --> 00:18:57,134
I have to do at least
this much or else, see?

375
00:18:57,614 --> 00:18:59,673
This is what it means to live here.

376
00:19:00,794 --> 00:19:01,676
That's awesome!

377
00:19:02,174 --> 00:19:04,491
It's great you have a healthy
way to blow off steam.

378
00:19:04,574 --> 00:19:07,633
But considering that, why
don't we try to calm down?

379
00:19:08,534 --> 00:19:13,240
Well, Hero, the truth is, I don't even
have the freedom to leave if I wanted to.

380
00:19:13,814 --> 00:19:17,011
You have to understand, my
mother died when I was born.

381
00:19:17,094 --> 00:19:19,854
So my father became
overly protective of me.

382
00:19:20,374 --> 00:19:23,951
I don't have any friends close
to my age who share my station.

383
00:19:24,034 --> 00:19:26,622
No memories of running
across grassy fields.

384
00:19:26,714 --> 00:19:27,544
Nothing.

385
00:19:28,234 --> 00:19:31,058
I've never found anything
I really wanted to do.

386
00:19:31,374 --> 00:19:32,903
It all feels so pointless.

387
00:19:34,274 --> 00:19:35,104
Okay.

388
00:19:35,574 --> 00:19:36,868
I've seen this before.

389
00:19:37,754 --> 00:19:39,754
No wonder I can't leave her alone.

390
00:19:40,434 --> 00:19:41,264
Princess.

391
00:19:42,254 --> 00:19:44,391
Is there anything that I can do for you?

392
00:19:44,474 --> 00:19:45,331
I'll help out.

393
00:19:45,414 --> 00:19:47,851
If you have something in your
head that you've been dreaming of?

394
00:19:47,934 --> 00:19:49,875
Then I want to make it a reality!

395
00:19:49,994 --> 00:19:51,254
Do you mean that?

396
00:19:51,494 --> 00:19:53,111
You really are going to help me?

397
00:19:53,194 --> 00:19:54,076
Yeah, of course

398
00:19:56,514 --> 00:19:58,814
Rise, my people! Yeah!

399
00:19:59,174 --> 00:20:03,591
A king has caught up an outward beauty
and forgets true Earth's adventure rule!

400
00:20:03,674 --> 00:20:05,994
Hold up, princess? What are we doing?

401
00:20:06,854 --> 00:20:10,814
The leaders of the rebellion are
Princess Ygrane and the hero.

402
00:20:11,194 --> 00:20:13,851
The rebel army is calling for a new ruler

403
00:20:13,934 --> 00:20:16,581
and the abolishment of
hereditary succession.

404
00:20:17,054 --> 00:20:19,034
How did this nightmare happen?

405
00:20:19,734 --> 00:20:20,794
It's too late.

406
00:20:20,914 --> 00:20:21,811
We have no choice.

407
00:20:21,894 --> 00:20:23,191
We'll deploy the military and...

408
00:20:23,274 --> 00:20:25,671
If we do that and Iggy
gets hurt, then what?

409
00:20:25,754 --> 00:20:26,584
We can't!

410
00:20:26,667 --> 00:20:27,497
It's impossible!

411
00:20:28,514 --> 00:20:29,344
Well then,

412
00:20:29,427 --> 00:20:32,591
what if we use the Intelligence Department
to contain the Princess in secret?

413
00:20:32,674 --> 00:20:33,615
Would that work?

414
00:20:34,094 --> 00:20:34,924
That's good.

415
00:20:35,634 --> 00:20:36,464
You got it?

416
00:20:36,554 --> 00:20:37,611
Intelligence Department!

417
00:20:37,694 --> 00:20:40,491
Isn't this the right time for a
deadweight department to shine?

418
00:20:40,574 --> 00:20:41,404
Can you do it?

419
00:20:41,654 --> 00:20:42,891
Yeah, of course we can!

420
00:20:42,974 --> 00:20:45,531
I just want to say good luck,
and we're all counting on you.

421
00:20:45,614 --> 00:20:48,751
So, the highlight was our Supervisor,
who couldn't seem to refuse,

422
00:20:48,834 --> 00:20:51,391
is now orchestrating a last-ditch
attack on the Rebel Army.

423
00:20:51,474 --> 00:20:52,594
I see.

424
00:20:52,874 --> 00:20:54,074
I guess that's good.

425
00:20:54,534 --> 00:20:56,814
Even when melancholy or sublime.

426
00:20:57,694 --> 00:20:59,354
Tachibana, what should I do?

427
00:21:00,434 --> 00:21:02,963
Staying with a rebel
army is too dangerous.

428
00:21:03,074 --> 00:21:06,271
I want to drag you back here
even if it's against your will.

429
00:21:06,354 --> 00:21:07,184
Yay!

430
00:21:08,334 --> 00:21:09,894
You better not follow me.

431
00:21:10,334 --> 00:21:14,071
Could it be that Tachibana actually
wanted to travel with that woman?

432
00:21:14,154 --> 00:21:15,634
That can't be it, right?

433
00:21:17,194 --> 00:21:18,024
No.

434
00:21:18,107 --> 00:21:18,937
It's possible.

435
00:21:19,614 --> 00:21:23,555
She's just the type Tachibana
usually likes, plus she's a princess.

436
00:21:23,774 --> 00:21:26,231
When we went to have the
king give her a scolding,

437
00:21:26,314 --> 00:21:29,432
was it actually to have the
king give his permission?

438
00:21:29,634 --> 00:21:32,458
Even though you don't
understand a single thing?

439
00:21:33,034 --> 00:21:35,734
Wait, I don't understand a single thing?

440
00:21:36,334 --> 00:21:39,922
Tachibana, I don't get it, what
the heck am I supposed to do?

441
00:21:44,314 --> 00:21:45,144
Hmm?

442
00:21:45,874 --> 00:21:47,351
I shall give my report.

443
00:21:47,434 --> 00:21:50,854
I'm afraid that Mouria has
failed and been captured.

444
00:21:51,214 --> 00:21:52,714
So futile after all.

445
00:21:53,054 --> 00:21:55,631
Somehow, I had a feeling it would be...

446
00:21:55,714 --> 00:21:57,714
What a coincidence. So did I.

447
00:21:58,514 --> 00:21:59,934
No other choice.

448
00:22:01,694 --> 00:22:03,414
Call in that person!

449
00:22:03,954 --> 00:22:05,174
What person?

450
00:22:46,014 --> 00:22:47,414
Oh

451
00:22:53,814 --> 00:22:55,214
Yeah

452
00:23:47,574 --> 00:23:50,633
Reincarnated as a fantasy
knockout and a rebel army.
